  {
    "id": "2637f99cfa9f76b898c9",
    "source": "English SRD or pack name ('Potion of Healing') when item is the table's own; omit for invented loot. E.g. 'Longsword' for item 'Spada lunga': the server reads what it does from that item. A magic weapon or armor built on a chosen base is named with it as the SRD writes it ('Flame Tongue Scimitar', 'Vicious Rapier', 'Mithral Half Plate', 'Chain Mail of Fire Resistance'). Also omit when item already is that English name, and while it is unidentified.",
